    "answer": {
      "short": "$y=2x-3x^2+19$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y&=2x-3x^2+C\\\\3&=2(-2)-3(-2)^2+C\\\\3&=-4-12+C\\\\C&=19\\\\y&=2x-3x^2+19\\end{align*}$$",
